              <calculation class='tableau' formula='if isnull([Avg sku per vendor (copy)_982066193984061443]) then 0&#10;elseif ([Avg sku per vendor (copy)_982066193984061443] - [no of sku per vendor l7period avg  (copy)_982066193984401412])/abs([no of sku per vendor l7period avg  (copy)_982066193984401412]) &gt;=0.3&#10;then 2&#10;elseif ([Avg sku per vendor (copy)_982066193984061443] - [no of sku per vendor l7period avg  (copy)_982066193984401412])/abs([no of sku per vendor l7period avg  (copy)_982066193984401412]) &lt;=-0.3 &#10;then -2&#10;elseif (([Avg sku per vendor (copy)_982066193984061443] - [no of sku per vendor l7period avg  (copy)_982066193984401412])/abs([no of sku per vendor l7period avg  (copy)_982066193984401412]) &gt;= 0.2)&#10;then 1&#10;elseif ([Avg sku per vendor (copy)_982066193984061443] - [no of sku per vendor l7period avg  (copy)_982066193984401412])/abs([no of sku per vendor l7period avg  (copy)_982066193984401412]) &lt;=-0.2&#10;then -1&#10;else 0&#10;end'>
